.DS_Store

# Web build output / toolchain (see web/README.md for how to (re)build)
web/build/
web/build-rel/
web/build-st/
web/emsdk/
web/dist/
web/node_modules/
*.wasm
*.wasm.map
*.o
*.a

# Symlinks (re)created by web/CMakeLists.txt's file(CREATE_LINK ...) at configure time —
# always absolute-path, tied to whatever machine configured the build, so must never be committed.
web/public/audio
web/public/Eden.eden

# Native (CMake) build output — see native/README.md for how to (re)build
native/build/
native/build-*/

# Defense in depth: publish-to-edencom.sh never copies these from the private Emod repo,
# but ignore them here too in case anyone works in this checkout directly.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
WORKING/
